sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Any portal user
  participant W as Web login page
  participant API as Habitus API
  participant C as Consent store

  U->>W: Open login page
  W-->>U: Show cookie consent banner (essential vs non-essential)
  U->>W: Accept or reject non-essential cookies
  W->>W: Persist cookie preference locally
  U->>W: Submit credentials
  W->>API: Authenticate
  API->>C: Read RGPD consent status
  alt RGPD terms not yet accepted
    API-->>W: Access blocked, terms required
    W-->>U: Show RGPD terms (blocking)
    U->>W: Accept terms
    W->>API: POST /me/consents {rgpd: accepted}
    API->>C: Persist acceptance
    C-->>API: Stored
    API-->>W: Access granted
  else Terms already accepted
    API-->>W: Access granted
  end
  W-->>U: Enter portal
